# The build context is the REPOSITORY ROOT, not backend/ — the API image needs
# `database/prisma/schema` to generate its client, and Docker cannot reach above
# its context. See backend/Dockerfile.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage

# Never bake secrets or local state into a layer.
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
**/*.pem

.git
.github
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/.vscode
**/.idea

# Not needed by the API image.
frontend
docs
**/*.md
!backend/README.md
